    {
      "id": "yuan-170",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "南吕·四块玉·恬退",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "马致远",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "绿鬓衰，朱颜改，羞把尘容画麟台。故园风景依然在：三顷田，五亩宅，归去来。\n绿水边，青山侧，二顷良田一区宅。闲身跳出红尘外：紫蟹肥，黄菊开，归去来。\n酒旋沽，鱼新买，满眼云山画图开。清风明月还诗债。本是个懒散人，又无甚经济才，归去来。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "09fbe206b982eda6d7d8e2aff3c05c3384fed454a7fc665e8c85cb771b12182d",
      "estimatedOutput": 832,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-170--09fbe206b982eda6d7d8e2aff3c05c3384fed454a7fc665e8c85cb771b12182d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-171",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "南吕·四块玉·叹世",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "马致远",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "两鬓皤，中年过，图甚区区苦张罗。人间宠辱都参破。种春风二顷田，远红尘千丈波，倒大来闲快活。\n带月行，披星走，孤馆寒食故乡秋。妻儿胖了咱消瘦。枕上忧，马上愁，死后休。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c02605a0091d998282df9182e8042adaa6b136bf3b4676958cdbaa50058b03b9",
      "estimatedOutput": 764,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-171--c02605a0091d998282df9182e8042adaa6b136bf3b4676958cdbaa50058b03b9.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-172",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·寿阳曲（二首）",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "马致远",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "云笼月，风弄铁，两般儿助人凄切。剔银灯欲将心事写，长吁气一声吹灭。\n一阵风，一阵雨，满城中落花飞絮。纱窗外蓦然闻杜宇，一声声唤回春去。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "9f776cccc5e3a2e94256f9aac420d82625ce7adf3ba138bd6f773ae470aeccce",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-172--9f776cccc5e3a2e94256f9aac420d82625ce7adf3ba138bd6f773ae470aeccce.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-173",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "中吕·红绣鞋",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "挨着靠着云窗同坐，看着笑着月枕双歌，听着数着愁着怕着早四更过。\n四更过，情未足；情未足，夜如梭。天哪，更闰一更儿妨甚么！",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3a19c358c74146ee5c3e4265c618a405a0c84de0158be743a411a2194ea105ab",
      "estimatedOutput": 720,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-173--3a19c358c74146ee5c3e4265c618a405a0c84de0158be743a411a2194ea105ab.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-174",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "正宫·塞鸿秋·代人作",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "战西风遥天几点宾鸿至，感起我南朝千古伤心事。\n展花笺欲写几句知心事，空教我停霜毫半晌无才思。\n往常得兴时，一扫无瑕疵。今日个病恹恹，刚写下两个相思字。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "872a6c69e4d25827229b15ccee061e7e519a47d684e06167fe4ee44cf4b0d48a",
      "estimatedOutput": 750,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-174--872a6c69e4d25827229b15ccee061e7e519a47d684e06167fe4ee44cf4b0d48a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-175",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·水仙子·田家",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "绿阴茅屋两三间，院后溪流门外山。山桃野杏开无限，怕春光虚过眼，得浮生半日清闲。邀邻翁为伴，使家僮过盏，直吃的老瓦盆干。\n满林红叶乱翩翩，醉尽秋霜锦树残。苍苔静拂题诗看。酒微温石鼎寒，瓦杯深洗尽愁烦，衣宽解，事不关，直吃得老瓦盆干。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f15f380146c9db4d81c4d112cc0d5fdc61d96ddb95e2d218cb222d6b33ec2abd",
      "estimatedOutput": 830,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-175--f15f380146c9db4d81c4d112cc0d5fdc61d96ddb95e2d218cb222d6b33ec2abd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-176",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "南吕·金字经",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "蛾眉能自惜，别离泪似倾，休唱阳关第四声。情，夜深愁寤醒。人孤零，萧萧月三更。\n泪贱描金袖，不知心为谁。芳草萋萋人未归。期，一春鱼雁稀。人憔悴，愁堆八字眉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "7288e7268b58d7b4237db8bf3bcabc43f23d34b498e90ea8970e65984714c2a6",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-176--7288e7268b58d7b4237db8bf3bcabc43f23d34b498e90ea8970e65984714c2a6.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-177",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "越调·凭栏人·题情",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "花债萦牵酒病魔，谁唱相思肠断歌？旧愁没奈何，更添新恨多。\n情泪新痕压旧痕，心事相关谁共论？黄昏深闭门，被儿独自温。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b48719c3d425ab3854d483bc1f784b91c3b4de91ae90aaadd3ade9e1bb7e6649",
      "estimatedOutput": 714,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-177--b48719c3d425ab3854d483bc1f784b91c3b4de91ae90aaadd3ade9e1bb7e6649.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-178",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·蟾宫曲·送春",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "问东君何处天涯。落日啼鹃，流水桃花。淡淡遥山，萋萋芳草，隐隐残霞。随柳絮吹归那答，趁游丝惹在谁家。倦理琵琶，人倚秋千，月照窗纱。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "35a92d5bbacef1d68cdea71521320ae68e47a0baf44202b0c519cd34e3ecaa1c",
      "estimatedOutput": 728,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-178--35a92d5bbacef1d68cdea71521320ae68e47a0baf44202b0c519cd34e3ecaa1c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-179",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "双调·清江引·惜别",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "贯云石",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "玉人泣别声渐杳，无语伤怀抱。寂寞武陵源，细雨连芳草，都被他带将春去了。\n若还与他相见时，道个真传示。不是不修书，不是无才思，绕清江买不得天样纸。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "993a2b0756631313aa00a6e4e7340c96848e5b30ebce55cee3d1b1ca9d110c01",
      "estimatedOutput": 744,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-179--993a2b0756631313aa00a6e4e7340c96848e5b30ebce55cee3d1b1ca9d110c01.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-180",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "中吕·满庭芳",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "姚燧",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "天风海涛，昔人曾此，酒圣诗豪。我到此闲登眺，日远天高。山接水茫茫渺渺，水连天隐隐迢迢。供吟笑。功名事了，不待老僧招。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d09f46d3b9b254fefd426260585ec734432ee311120a2e544a78d4338c197dac",
      "estimatedOutput": 716,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/yuan-180--d09f46d3b9b254fefd426260585ec734432ee311120a2e544a78d4338c197dac.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "yuan-181",
      "category": "元曲",
      "title": "中吕·阳春曲·知几",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "白朴",
      "dynasty": "元",
      "content": "知荣知辱牢缄口，谁是谁非暗点头。诗书丛里且淹留。闲袖手，贫煞也风流。\n不因酒困因诗困，常被吟魂恼醉魂。四时风月一闲身。无用人，诗酒乐天真。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "00674a1dcab8f5ea1aa01a51f0af382b8e889e67d82be213ebb167a83ece72da",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
